    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marooned on the hostile alien expanse of Aethergald, your mission is no longer just discovery\u2014it's survival. Face off against formidable creatures, navigate treacherous landscapes, and harness alien technology to fight your way back from the brink.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799030/extras/7324bd14346687f80d67a7d0696b0a97.avif?t=1748888557\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799030/extras/8c871bf86902795bbc40745baf0e42b1.poster.avif?t=1748888557\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799030/extras/8c871bf86902795bbc40745baf0e42b1.webm?t=1748888557\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799030/extras/8c871bf86902795bbc40745baf0e42b1.mp4?t=1748888557\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Alien Encounters:</strong> Battle the island's creatures and monsters using a versatile arsenal of weapons, including the Static Staff, Energy Pistols, and much more as you traverse through the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Exploration &amp; Resource Management:</strong> Scour 5 diverse biomes in order to find ship pieces to escape the island once and for all. But be careful, these pieces are guarded by waves of enemies, so it's not going to be easy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Stakes Traversal Skills:</strong> Use climbing ropes to get to parts you couldn't get to before, use jump pads to go even higher than normal, and more things you'll be seeing with the island's tech.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unearth Powerful Lost Tech:</strong> Discover and repurpose forgotten alien technology to gain an edge against the dangers of Aethergald.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799030/extras/ef9cc73b258494b7c46ca24e139aa534.avif?t=1748888557\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use your Static Staff to defeat these foes:\u00a0</strong>The only way to stop them and keep them away is by defeating them. Use your Static Staff and defeat them to make your way to the exit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shoot your Static Discharge:</strong> With the Static Staff, you'll be able to use the Static Discharge, where if you align it correctly, it shoots a wave of electricity towards enemies! That's one of the many abilities you'll find in weapons in this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799030/extras/b40aeb39287ae28de907bf0ef28ac245.avif?t=1748888557\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The odds are stacked against you. Do you have what it takes to tame this savage world in The Explorer?</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marooned on the hostile alien expanse of Aethergald, your mission is no longer just discovery\u2014it's survival. Face off against formidable creatures, navigate treacherous landscapes, and harness alien technology to fight your way back from the brink.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799030/extras/7324bd14346687f80d67a7d0696b0a97.avif?t=1748888557\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799030/extras/8c871bf86902795bbc40745baf0e42b1.poster.avif?t=1748888557\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799030/extras/8c871bf86902795bbc40745baf0e42b1.webm?t=1748888557\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799030/extras/8c871bf86902795bbc40745baf0e42b1.mp4?t=1748888557\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Alien Encounters:</strong> Battle the island's creatures and monsters using a versatile arsenal of weapons, including the Static Staff, Energy Pistols, and much more as you traverse through the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Exploration &amp; Resource Management:</strong> Scour 5 diverse biomes in order to find ship pieces to escape the island once and for all. But be careful, these pieces are guarded by waves of enemies, so it's not going to be easy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Stakes Traversal Skills:</strong> Use climbing ropes to get to parts you couldn't get to before, use jump pads to go even higher than normal, and more things you'll be seeing with the island's tech.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unearth Powerful Lost Tech:</strong> Discover and repurpose forgotten alien technology to gain an edge against the dangers of Aethergald.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799030/extras/ef9cc73b258494b7c46ca24e139aa534.avif?t=1748888557\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use your Static Staff to defeat these foes:\u00a0</strong>The only way to stop them and keep them away is by defeating them. Use your Static Staff and defeat them to make your way to the exit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shoot your Static Discharge:</strong> With the Static Staff, you'll be able to use the Static Discharge, where if you align it correctly, it shoots a wave of electricity towards enemies! That's one of the many abilities you'll find in weapons in this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2799030/extras/b40aeb39287ae28de907bf0ef28ac245.avif?t=1748888557\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The odds are stacked against you. Do you have what it takes to tame this savage world in The Explorer?</strong></p>",
